file_name": "Calculator Two Memory Cells 4 2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1141123477217178", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1141123480550511_7944056824242099643_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ShVHG4JiKdAQ7kNvwGcw9OV&_nc_oc=AdotDEoeRSEl2xYOCYqJ4DKvYELNpbyi5yPKjZ1oh7qRdl0fH_X1yEOCGFFj0IZVG8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU1-hBct8weNiyO3ph5BJMbCLi-9aMN3rTVpNv8O5ItBA&oe=6B1058E1"}, "display_name": "Calculator two memory cells", "keywords": ["calculator", "math", "quest3", "utility", "memory"], "long_description": "**NEW v1.3.7**\n* **Scale pop-up** \u2014 wrist-menu, resize the calculator from 0.1 \u00d7 to 1 \u00d7 in one tap.  \n* **Apartment shadows & colours** \u2014 minor lighting tweaks for softer, more natural look.  \n* **Player movement** \u2014 free locomotion: **Left Stick = move, Right Stick = turn**.  \n* **Grabbable calculator** \u2014 new collider lets you pick up / reposition the calculator in VR & MR more comfortable.\n\n---\n\n### Why Dual-memory calculator?\n**Dual Memory Cells** \u2014 store & swap two numbers instantly for complex chains.  \n**Intuitive UI** \u2014 big, colour-coded buttons you can hit with controllers *or* hand tracking.  \n**Basic Operations** \u2014 add, subtract, multiply, divide, percent.  \n**Precision Engine** \u2014 28-29 significant digits, range \u22127.9 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u2078 \u2026 +7.9 \u00d7 10\u00b2\u2078.  \n\n---\n\n### Quick Tips\n* Turn your wrist \u2192 slide **Scale** to resize.  \n* Tap the **Passthrough toggle** at the wrist menu to enter Passthrough; tap again to return to Apartment.\n\nNo personal data collected. Requires only the *PASSTHROUGH_CAMERA* permission provided by Meta XR SDK v77.", "short_description": "Calculator VR & Mixed Reality \u2014 resizable dual-memory calculator for Meta Quest. Switch between Mixed-Reality passthrough and a cosy VR Room, crunch numbers with 28-digit precision, and store two values for instant recall.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xr-meta.com/privacy-policy-calculator-2-memory.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Individual Entrepreneur Sergii Kulish", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://xr-meta.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24078917151743994"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391892_664749129445109_4946171028246235498_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bxYxpswueFMQ7kNvwHsq2d3&_nc_oc=AdquMnjdXDPLICFwqZWZ39HGH2mPhy30xNqEsJ2StHK9YnB9bBlsoKQRkVoUZOCGs30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVFYn8qdRl1TM5sXaDwZkr0XrZZ97hzmtfmWfWzyPGdYA&oe=6B103F08"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Calculator two memory cells", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Productivity", "id": "1063584910766706"}], "release_date": 1742845140, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "9303752429687043", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application"